      "cooked": "<p>I have a question, though I'm pretty sure I know the answer.</p><p>If Legacy has the Legacy Ring and two Next Evolutions, can he use them to become immune to two different types of damage?</p><p>I'm fairly certain this is a no, but a friend of mine wants me to check.</p>",
