      "created_at": "2013-08-22T21:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is definitely doable, not easy to pull off, but awesome when you do pull it off.</p><p>Did this once with Visionary shutting down enviro damage, I think the villain was Apostate, so two damage types mainly. &nbsp;It was game over from there.</p><p>If you had Fanatic play embolden on Legacy you could do all three of them. &nbsp;Would probably be overkill though, and you couldn't choose radiant.</p>",
