      "created_at": "2013-08-22T22:10:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Believe these folks, Phantom5613 - they know what they're talking about.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\">  (Honestly, they have to correct me half the time…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"> )</p>\n<p>Generally, if the entire collection of responses are one way (as in this case), you can bet it's the right answer. And Spiff's really good about making sure his FAQ has only sanctioned rulings.</p>",
