    {
      "id": 71341,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-23T20:44:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Basically cards with powers that are limited are limited to prevent this, and those that aren't are intended to be able to have multiple ones out for just this reason.</p><p>Like Wraith, her Razor Ord. and Throwing Knives are limited to prevent doubling up that particular damage. &nbsp;Stun Bolts aren't, get the belt and two bolts out and you get to use both for -2 to damage for your enemy (assuming you shoot the same target with both).</p><p>Visionary can do it with Mass Levitation, Tachyon with research grant, Bunker's Maintenance unit, etc.</p><p>The entire reason those cards are limited or not is specifically for the situations where that hero is able to use multiple powers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:50:28.488Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
