      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Basically cards with powers that are limited are limited to prevent this, and those that aren&#39;t are intended to be able to have multiple ones out for just this reason.</p><p>Like Wraith, her Razor Ord. and Throwing Knives are limited to prevent doubling up that particular damage. &nbsp;Stun Bolts aren&#39;t, get the belt and two bolts out and you get to use both for -2 to damage for your enemy (assuming you shoot the same target with both).</p><p>Visionary can do it with Mass Levitation, Tachyon with research grant, Bunker&#39;s Maintenance unit, etc.</p><p>The entire reason those cards are limited or not is specifically for the situations where that hero is able to use multiple powers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
